{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/extras/0f4ee10e8104d27348308af5a9dd9654.avif?t=1763996475\" width=1280 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the rise of the Roman Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the Pyrrhic War.\u00a0 Can you defend the Republic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War has broken out between Rome and the unruly city of Tarentum, one of the last major cities in Italia not under the Senate\u2019s control. Outmatched, Tarentum has called for aid from the Kingdom of Epirus in Greece. A modern, disciplined army the likes of which Rome has never faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by their king, Pyrrhus, cousin of Alexander the Great, they are truly a force to be reckoned with. General, it is your task to stop them and bring glory to Rome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/extras/b03860cb7199baf29b9c8c25aff58eb8.avif?t=1763996475\" width=265 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are handcrafted, based on historical battles and settings, and drawn in a retro pixel-art style. Bonus objectives provide players with greater challenges and unlock new campaign paths, leading to a dynamic and highly repayable experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Supply Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build forts along roads to resupply your units in battle. Keep the roads clear to ensure your forts stay supplied. This simple yet historically inspired mechanic gives <i>Roman General</i> a unique layer of strategic depth in managing supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010340?t=1763996475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010340?t=1763996475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/520d50ac574fec6ce0d03efe49fb326e6a14d098/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763996475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/520d50ac574fec6ce0d03efe49fb326e6a14d098/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763996475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4134480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/extras/0f4ee10e8104d27348308af5a9dd9654.avif?t=1763996475\" width=1280 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the rise of the Roman Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the Pyrrhic War.\u00a0 Can you defend the Republic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War has broken out between Rome and the unruly city of Tarentum, one of the last major cities in Italia not under the Senate\u2019s control. Outmatched, Tarentum has called for aid from the Kingdom of Epirus in Greece. A modern, disciplined army the likes of which Rome has never faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by their king, Pyrrhus, cousin of Alexander the Great, they are truly a force to be reckoned with. General, it is your task to stop them and bring glory to Rome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/extras/b03860cb7199baf29b9c8c25aff58eb8.avif?t=1763996475\" width=265 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are handcrafted, based on historical battles and settings, and drawn in a retro pixel-art style. Bonus objectives provide players with greater challenges and unlock new campaign paths, leading to a dynamic and highly repayable experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Supply Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build forts along roads to resupply your units in battle. Keep the roads clear to ensure your forts stay supplied. This simple yet historically inspired mechanic gives <i>Roman General</i> a unique layer of strategic depth in managing supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Moore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010340/788242e4788d10b0e6f5cc8f8362a2ea0822a1b7/header.jpg?t=1763996475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  OS: Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD, Dual Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia\u00ae GeForce\u2122 GTX 460 (1GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 HD 7870 (2GB) / Intel\u00ae Iris Pro\u2122 580 / Intel\u00ae Iris\u00ae Plus G7 / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 Vega 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"m